# D3-BD-003: An irradiation command is not proof of a supported photochemical pathway
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 40mL
add v1 H2O2 0.0001mol
add v2 water 40mL
add v2 H2O2 0.0001mol
add v3 water 40mL
seal v1 500mL
seal v2 500mL
seal v3 500mL
irradiate v1 254nm 1W/m2
irradiate v3 254nm 1W/m2
wait 10min
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
measure v3 pressure
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
